# InfluencerForge rules

- Follow `PROJECT_SPECIFICATION.md`, `AGENTS.md`, and `docs/`.
- Keep local-first architecture: UI → FastAPI `:8765` → SQLite / workers.
- Phase 1 generation is stubbed; do not vendor multi-GB models into git.
- Every feature change needs tests + docs updates.
- Commits from AI passes must include trailer `AI-Generated: true`.
- Ask the user before pushing, force-pushing, or destructive git operations.
- Prefer Conventional Commits and small, phase-aligned changes.
